+    The acquisition/FF writer boundaries are memory-only. No source is dot-sourced.
+.PARAMETER Case
+    O5 has five inputs; O6 has eighteen expanded inputs.
+.EXAMPLE
+    ./new-ps-unit.ps1 -Case O5
+.NOTES
+    Requires: PowerShell 7.6.7 (ps7); ordinary user; no Pester/module/framework.
